    "comments": "BinuRaj\nBinuRaj\n\n3 years, 1 month ago\nPrivileged Identity Management provides time-based and approval-based role activation to mitigate the risks of excessive,\nunnecessary, or misused access permissions on resources that you care about. Here are some of the key features of Privileged\nIdentity Management:\nProvide just-in-time privileged access to Azure AD and Azure resources\nAssign time-bound access to resources using start and end dates\nRequire approval to activate privileged roles\nEnforce multi-factor authentication to activate any role\nUse justification to understand why users activate\nGet notifications when privileged roles are activated\nConduct access reviews to ensure users still need roles\nDownload audit history for internal or external audit\nPrevents removal of the last active Global Administrator role assignment\np7kumbhare\np7kumbhare\n\n3 years ago\nCorrect service would be Azure AD Identity Protection.\n\n1 month, 3 weeks ago\nCommunity vote distribution\nB (100%)\n\nJas001\nJas001\n\n1 month, 3 weeks ago\nSelected Answer:\nB\nAzure AD Identity Protection.\nUmesh919\nUmesh919\n\n1 month, 4 weeks ago\nSelected Answer:\nB\nAzure AD identity protection\nsulina27\nsulina27\n\n2 months ago\nSelected Answer:\nB\nEntra ID Protection is the answer\nadu72\nadu72\n\n3 months, 4 weeks ago\nThe answer is B. APIM is not used to force to change password if logged from unknow IP. It is Conditional Access that can be\nused to force pwd change.\nAlonsochaves\nAlonsochaves\n\n5 months ago\nAzure Identity Protection will work, not need for Azured AD privileged identity mananagement\nintentando\nintentando\n\n9 months, 1 week ago\nSelected Answer:\nB\nB\njakerson\njakerson\n\n1 year, 1 month ago\nSelected Answer:\nB\nTo address the goal of automatically encouraging users to change passwords when connecting to Azure AD from an unident",
