    "comments": "Olufavour\nOlufavour\n\n1 year, 10 months ago\nGeo-distribution makes you deploy apps and data to regional datacenters around the globe that is close to your customer to\nensure best performance.\nKittu1102\nKittu1102\n\n5 months, 1 week ago\nGeo-distribution\nmhj_23df\nmhj_23df\n\n1 year ago\ngeo-distribution you can deploy apps and data to regional datacenters around the globe\nazirila\nazirila\n\n1 year, 7 months ago\nAnswer is correct (geodistrubution)\nbuiducvu\nbuiducvu\n\n1 year, 8 months ago\nGeo-distribution\nis correct\nMarMar2022\nMarMar2022\n\n1 year, 10 months ago\nI Agree Geo-Distribution\nwazmac\nwazmac\n\n1 year, 11 months ago\nAnswer is correct - 'Geo-distribution'.\nMushfig\nMushfig\n\n1 year, 11 months ago\nwhat is correct answer?\nConviction454\nConviction454\n\n1 year, 11 months ago\nCorrect Answer is Geo-Distribution. The key words here seem to be \"close to users\" and Geo-Distribution is the only answer\nrelevant to location of Azure Resources.",
