    "comments": "gelato\ngelato\n\n4 years, 8 months ago\nWhy is this being asked for Azure Fundamentals? This kind of question is like for experience. The goal of Azure Fundamentals is\nonly to make you aware of the services it offers and how to navigate the Azure portal.\nTurak64\nTurak64\n\n3 years, 7 months ago\nYou're not being asked how to do this, just that you demostrate a knowledge of virutal networks. Tbh, it's not that hard of a\nquestion if you read it through properly.\nsuccess101\nsuccess101\n\n5 years, 1 month ago\nB is correct. This is a network segmentation.\nDidiclimb85\nDidiclimb85\n\n3 months, 1 week ago\nquedan muchas sin ver? merece la pena comprarlo?\nCommunity vote distribution\nB (100%)\n\nNoursBear\nNoursBear\n\n7 months, 1 week ago\nwow this is question 110 and I have already reached the end of the free questions.\nNormally you would get about 200.\nI always buy\nthe rest of the questions but getting only 11 pages for free on this test is a bit mean.\nsree1805\nsree1805\n\n10 months, 4 weeks ago\nCORRECT\nprashanthojai\nprashanthojai\n\n1 year, 8 months ago\nAnswer B\nAzExamUser\nAzExamUser\n\n2 years, 1 month ago\nB is correct.\nAzure virtual networks provide the 'Isolation and segmentation' networking capability.\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/describe-azure-compute-networking-services/8-virtual-network\nPhiPGN\nPhiPGN\n\n2 years, 4 months ago\nSelected Answer:\nB\nThe keyword here is \"segment\".\nThere was another question asked \"What is a feature of an Azure virtual network?\". The answer was \"isolation and segmentation\".\nSo B is the correct one.\nleusa\nleusa\n\n2 years, 6 months ago\nYes, Selected Answer: B Correct Answer..\nPa1theAchiever\nPa1theAchiever\n\n2 years, 7 months ago\noption B\ncuentaalternajsr\ncuentaalternajsr\n\n2 years, 8 months ago\nB, respuesta correcta.\nJKRowlings\nJKRowlings\n\n2 years, 1",
