    "comments": "KnowledgeGain\nKnowledgeGain\n\n2 years, 10 months ago\nYes, we can use bash/powershell\ngabrisiq\ngabrisiq\n\n1 year, 8 months ago\nthanks\nttn\nttn\n\n2 years, 11 months ago\nAgree, panal. However it had been more clear if it was mentioned that a browser on the Android tablet can be used to connect to\nAzure portal where Azure cloud shell can be accessed.\nSAFM\nSAFM\n\n4 months, 3 weeks ago\nSelected Answer:\nA\nCommunity vote distribution\nA (100%)\n\nYou can use any browser to launch Cloud Shell and from there choose Bash or Power shell.\nQL123456\nQL123456\n\n5 months, 2 weeks ago\nAzure vm does not support Android\nNet_IT\nNet_IT\n\n1 year ago\nSelected Answer:\nA\nNot practical but possible.\nLuansi\nLuansi\n\n1 year, 1 month ago\nSelected Answer:\nA\nYes, it is possible to use Bash in Azure Cloud Shell to create a new Azure virtual machine from a tablet that runs the Android\noperating system.\nAzure Cloud Shell is a browser-based command-line interface that allows you to manage your Azure resources from anywhere\nwith an Internet connection. It provides a choice of shells, including Bash and PowerShell, that you can use to run scripts and\ncommands to manage your Azure resources.\nlombri\nlombri\n\n1 year, 1 month ago\nSelected Answer:\nA\nAzure cloud shell can be accessed? So it's true !\nbuiducvu\nbuiducvu\n\n1 year, 1 month ago\nSelected Answer:\nA\nA- Yes\nTonyghostR05\nTonyghostR05\n\n1 year, 4 months ago\nThis can be try in microsoft testing notes\nIbeginhere2807\nIbeginhere2807\n\n1 year, 6 months ago\nA- Yes\nJtydasaz\nJtydasaz\n\n1 year, 7 months ago\nDo we need to buy exam topics as a contributor? I am not able access the contents after age 23. Please confirm if anyone already\nbought? Is it safe gto buy?\nPotatoes\nPotatoes\n\n1 year, 6 months ago\nYes, I bought it.\nRam_krishna\nRam_krishna\n\n1 year, 1 month ago\nkindly provide us th",
    "references": [],
    "questionZh": "注意：此問題是呈現相同場景的一系列問題的一部分。該系列中的每個問題都包含一個\n可能實現既定目標的獨特解決方案。有些問題集可能有多個正確答案，而其他問題集可能有多個正確答案\n可能沒有正確的解決方案。\n回答本部分的問題後，您將無法返回該部分。這樣一來，這些問題就不會出現在\n評論畫面。\n您有一個 Azure 環境。您需要從執行 Android 作業系統的平板電腦建立新的 Azure 虛擬機\n系統。\n解決方案：在 Azure Cloud Shell 中使用 Bash。\n這達到目標了嗎？",
