    "comments": "Himanshumittal500\nHimanshumittal500\n\n4 years ago\nA Content delivery Network\nis a distributed network of server that can efficiently deliver a web content to user.\nraedon\nraedon\n\n1 year, 9 months ago\nthanks\nGat\nGat\n\n4 years, 1 month ago\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cdn/\nBabyYodaIsCute\nBabyYodaIsCute\n\n10 months ago\nNo longer a part of the exam, isn't it?\nAZFabio\nAZFabio\n\n10 months ago\nSelected Answer:\nC\nCommunity vote distribution\nC (100%)\n\nCorrect\nRDIO\nRDIO\n\n1 year ago\nThis is out on the exam ? Don't remember seeing this on the learning path. Maybe I've missed it. Thanks.\nSAFM\nSAFM\n\n4 months, 3 weeks ago\nI agree, I would not expect it on the exam. I hope I'm not wrong, will let you know soon!\nftkftk\nftkftk\n\n1 year ago\nI feel the same..\nBereket\nBereket\n\n1 year, 1 month ago\nSelected Answer:\nC\nRight answer is CDN\nPinha\nPinha\n\n1 year, 1 month ago\nC\nA content delivery network (CDN) is a global network of servers that are designed to deliver content, such as web pages,\nimages, and videos, more efficiently to users. CDNs work by caching content at locations around the world and serving it from\nthe location that is closest to the user. This can significantly improve the performance and speed of delivering content to users,\nespecially for large video files.\nTaleeya\nTaleeya\n\n11 months, 1 week ago\nThanks for the explanation\nbuiducvu\nbuiducvu\n\n1 year, 1 month ago\nSelected Answer:\nC\nC. a content delivery network (CDN)\nmeister13\nmeister13\n\n1 year, 2 months ago\nSelected Answer:\nC\nindeed it will allow customer to enjoy efficient delivered web content\nJC_de_Sevilla\nJC_de_Sevilla\n\n1 year, 7 months ago\nSelected Answer:\nC\nContent Delivery Network (CDN)\nPa1theAchiever\nPa1theAchiever\n\n1 year, 7 months ago\ncontent delivery network(cdn)\nJKRowlings\nJKRowlings\n\n1 year, 10 months ago\nCon",
