    "id": 241,
    "topic": 1,
    "type": "hotspot",
    "question": "HOTSPOT -\nSelect the answer that correctly completes the sentence.\nHot Area:",
    "options": [],
    "answer": [],
    "answerText": "Box: Azure Active Directory (Azure AD)\nYou can enable single sign-on for an enterprise application through Azure Active Directory (Azure AD.\nIncorrect:\nApplication security groups enable you to configure network security as a natural extension of an application's structure,\nallowing you to group virtual machines and define network security policies based on those groups.\nReference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/active-directory/manage-apps/add-application-portal-setup-sso",
    "comments": "Truelle\nTruelle\n\n1 year, 6 months ago\nMicrosoft Entra ID is the new name for AAD or maybe exam has still the old one ?\nx_Examinator_x\nx_Examinator_x\n\n1 year, 4 months ago\n\nx_Examinator_x\nx_Examinator_x\n\n1 year, 4 months ago\nYou are right, MS naming is a hell\nkamal_004\nkamal_004\n\n2 years, 4 months ago\nAzure Active Directory (Azure AD) Enables users to authenticate to multiple applications using single sign-on (SSO), is this\ncorrect?\nKholio86\nKholio86\n\n7 months, 2 weeks ago\nNew name for MS AD is MS Entra ID\njrop_111\njrop_111\n\n2 years, 4 months ago\nCorrect!\nMolota\nMolota\n\n1 year, 9 months ago\nAzure AD\nzellck\nzellck\n\n2 years, 1 month ago\n\"Azure AD\" is the answer.\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/describe-azure-identity-access-security/2-directory-services\nAzure AD provides services such as:\n- Single sign-on: Single sign-on (SSO) enables you to remember only one username and one password to access multiple\napplications. A single identity is tied to a user, which simplifies the security model. As users change roles or leave an\norganization, access modifications are tied to that identity, which greatly reduces the effort needed to change or disable\naccounts.",
    "references": [
      "https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/active-directory/manage-apps/add-application-portal-setup-sso",
      "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/describe-azure-identity-access-security/2-directory-services"
    ],
    "questionZh": "熱點 -\n選出正確完成句子的答案。\n熱門區域：",
    "answerTextZh": "方塊： Azure Active Directory (Azure AD)\n您可以透過Azure Active Directory (Azure AD.\n不正確：\n應用程式安全羣組可讓您將網路安全設定為應用程式結構的自然延伸，\n允許您對虛擬機器進行分組，並根據這些羣組定義網路安全策略。\nReference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/active-directory/manage-apps/add-application-portal-setup-sso"
