    "questionZh": "熱點 -\n對於以下每個陳述，如果該陳述為真，請選擇「是」。否則，選擇否。\n注意：每個正確的選擇都值得一分。\n熱門區域：",
    "answerTextZh": "Box 1: 是 -\nWith Azure ExpressRoute, all inbound data transfer is free of charge.\n\nBox 2: 否 -\nInbound data traffic is free but outbound data traffic is not.\nBox 3: 是 -\n參考資料:\nhttps://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/pricing/details/expressroute/ https://azure.microsoft.com/en-\nus/pricing/details/bandwidth/"
