    "question": "DRAG DROP -\nYou need to identify a customer’s level of shared responsibility based on the cloud service model.\nIn which order should you list each model from most customer responsibility to least customer responsibility? To answer, move\nall models from the list of models to the answer area and arrange them in the correct order.",
    "options": [],
    "answer": [],
    "answerText": "PDF 的正解為圖片或熱區，請依解析與評論自我核對。",
    "comments": "Super63\nSuper63\n\n3 months, 3 weeks ago\nAnswer is correct.\nThere is a share of responsibility in the cloud\nIn here we have a nice little table.\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/security/fundamentals/shared-responsibility\nCustomer responsibilities from MOST to LEAST are:\n* On premisses\n* IaaS\n* PaaS\n* SaaS\nTehkl\nTehkl\n\n10 months, 1 week ago\n\nTehkl\nTehkl\n\n10 months, 1 week ago\nits in the exam - 17-April-2024\nukguy\nukguy\n\n11 months, 3 weeks ago\nIn order from most customer responsibility to least customer responsibility, the cloud service models typically are listed as\nfollows:\nInfrastructure as a Service (IaaS)\nPlatform as a Service (PaaS)\nSoftware as a Service (SaaS)\nIn IaaS, customers are responsible for managing and controlling the entire virtualized infrastructure, including applications,\nruntime, middleware, and OS, while the cloud provider manages the underlying infrastructure.\nIn PaaS, customers are responsible for managing and controlling applications and data, while the cloud provider manages the\nunderlying infrastructure, runtime, middleware, and OS.\nIn SaaS, customers are responsible only for managing and controlling their data and how they use the software, while the cloud\nprovider manages everything else, including the application itself and the underlying infrastructure.\nAndySmith\nAndySmith\n\n1 year, 2 months ago\nAnswer is correct:\nIaaS - customer has most responsibility for compute resources management (VMs, OS, SW installations, etc);\nPaaS - somewhere in the middle - configure e.g. AppService and deploy code there.\nSaaS - configure already deployed service, so customer provides only data. This is least responsibility.\nCMELLO\nCMELLO\n\n1 year, 5 months ago\nwow did i get that wrong, on top IAAS, most CUSTOMER RESPONSIBILITY.\ntesting tomorrow.\nCMELLO\nCMELLO",
